  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preventing and mitigating violence against civilians during Syria&apos;s transition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The overall aim of this project is to increase human security during Syria&#xbf;s transition, with particular attention to minority and other vulnerable groups.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Specific Objectives/Outcomes: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;This will be achieved through a three-pronged strategy that aims to achieve the following over 18 months:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Increased adoption of approaches and practices in accordance with international humanitarian and human rights law by security services and armed groups engaged in security operations and law enforcement&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Increased alignment of armed groups&#xbf; policies and operational frameworks with international humanitarian norms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Enhanced cooperation between CSOs, local communities and armed groups and security actors in the peaceful resolution of disputes and critical issues that impact community stability and human security&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
